{"seq":3,"slug":"drought-resilient-crops","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 抗旱作物育种与种质创新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/climate-adaptation/drought-resilient-crops","wordCount":2250,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-可持续农业-抗旱作物育种与种质创新\">研究生 可持续农业 — 抗旱作物育种与种质创新</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>干旱是全球范围内限制作物产量最严重的非生物胁迫因素，每年造成的农业损失超过其他所有非生物胁迫因素的总和。随着气候变化加剧，预计到2050年全球将有超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 的可耕地面临中度到重度干旱风险。抗旱作物的研究与开发已从传统的经验选择演进为多学科交叉的系统工程，涵盖分子生物学、生理生态学、基因组学和作物模型等多个领域。</p>\n<p>抗旱性的核心概念框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>干旱逃避（Drought Escape）</strong>：通过调整生育期避开干旱敏感时期，如早熟品种在终花期前完成灌浆</li>\n<li><strong>干旱避免（Drought Avoidance）</strong>：维持组织高水势，通过深根系提高水分获取能力或通过气孔调控减少水分散失</li>\n<li><strong>干旱耐受（Drought Tolerance）</strong>：在低水势条件下维持细胞功能，涉及渗透调节、抗氧化防御和细胞保护蛋白</li>\n<li><strong>干旱恢复（Drought Recovery）</strong>：干旱解除后快速恢复正常生长的能力，与碳储备动员和茎尖分生组织活力相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四种策略在不同作物和生态环境中的相对重要性差异巨大。有效的抗旱育种必须明确目标环境的干旱模式（早旱、花期旱、终期旱）和目标农户的生产系统特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"干旱胁迫的植物生理学基础\">干旱胁迫的植物生理学基础</h3><p>植物感知和响应干旱的过程是一个从物理信号到分子级联再到整株适应的多层次过程。当根际土壤水势下降时，根系首先合成并释放脱落酸（ABA），ABA 通过木质部运输到地上部分，触发气孔关闭反应。气孔导度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）的降低减少了蒸腾失水，但同时也限制了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入叶肉细胞，导致光合速率下降。</p>\n<p>水分亏缺对光合作用的影响可分为气孔限制和非气孔限制两个阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>干旱程度</th>\n<th>叶片水势</th>\n<th>主要限制因素</th>\n<th>生理表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mtext> MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1.0\\ \\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>气孔限制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降低，光合速率轻度下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mtext> MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2.0\\ \\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>气孔 + 非气孔限制</td>\n<td>光系统 II 效率下降，RuBisCO 活性降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mtext> MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; -2.0\\ \\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>非气孔限制为主</td>\n<td>活性氧（ROS）爆发，膜系统损伤，蛋白质变性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>渗透调节（Osmotic Adjustment）是植物耐旱的核心生理机制之一。通过主动积累兼容性溶质（脯氨酸、甜菜碱、可溶性糖等），细胞降低渗透势以维持膨压：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi_p = \\Psi_w - \\Psi_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为膨压，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为水势，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为渗透势。渗透调节能力强的品种在中度干旱下可维持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext> MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3-0.6\\ \\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的正膨压，保证细胞扩展和气孔部分开放。</p>\n<h3 id=\"抗旱性的遗传基础与qtl定位\">抗旱性的遗传基础与QTL定位</h3><p>抗旱性是典型的数量性状，受多基因控制且与环境存在强烈的交互作用（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G \\times E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>）。全基因组关联分析（GWAS）和QTL定位揭示了数百个与抗旱相关的基因组区域，但单个位点的效应通常较小（解释表型变异的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\%-15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p>水稻抗旱育种中最成功的案例是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>12.1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">qDTY_{12.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等主效QTL的发现和利用。该QTL在严重干旱条件下可提高产量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext> kg/ha</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300-500\\ \\text{kg/ha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg/ha</span></span></span></span></span></span>，已被导入多个热带水稻品种中。其优势在于效应稳定、遗传背景影响小，适合标记辅助回交育种（MABC）。</p>\n<p>关键抗旱基因家族包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DREB/CBF 转录因子</strong>：调控下游多个抗逆基因的表达，过表达可显著提高转基因植株的抗旱性，但可能伴随生长抑制（&quot;yield penalty&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>LEA 蛋白家族</strong>：在脱水条件下大量积累，充当分子伴侣保护蛋白质和膜结构</li>\n<li><strong>ABA 信号通路组分</strong>：PYR/PYL 受体、PP2C 磷酸酶、SnRK2 激酶构成的核心信号模块</li>\n<li><strong>根系构型基因</strong>：如水稻 DEEPER ROOTING 1（DRO1）控制根系生长角度，影响深层水分获取</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"现代育种技术平台\">现代育种技术平台</h3><p><strong>高通量表型组学</strong>革命性地改变了抗旱筛选的效率和精度。无人机搭载多光谱和热红外传感器可快速获取大面积田间试验的冠层温度、NDVI 和植被含水量等指标。冠层温度差（CTD, Canopy Temperature Depression）反映了蒸腾速率和根系水分获取能力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CTD</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>air</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>canopy</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CTD} = T_{\\text{air}} - T_{\\text{canopy}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">air</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">canopy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CTD 值越大（即冠层温度越低于气温），表明蒸腾冷却效应越强，根系吸水能力越好。在干旱条件下，高 CTD 值是优良抗旱性的可靠指标。</p>\n<p>**基因组选择（Genomic Selection, GS）**利用全基因组标记信息预测个体的育种值，跳过了传统QTL定位中的统计检测环节。GS 模型的预测准确性取决于训练群体大小、标记密度和性状遗传结构。对于抗旱性这类低遗传力性状，GS 的优势在于能够捕获大量微效QTL的累积效应。GS 预测模型的一般形式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>p</mi></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{g}_i = \\sum_{j=1}^{p} x_{ij} \\hat{\\beta}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1123em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6985em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3471em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{g}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为个体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的基因组估计育种值（GEBV），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为标记基因型，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.244em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为标记效应的估计值。</p>\n<p><strong>CRISPR/Cas9 精准编辑</strong>为抗旱改良开辟了新途径。通过编辑负调控因子（如 OsERA1、SlMAPK3）可以增强抗旱响应而不引入外源基因。&quot;编辑而非转基因&quot;的策略在监管接受度上具有显著优势。</p>\n<h3 id=\"参与式品种选育与农户适应\">参与式品种选育与农户适应</h3><p>技术上优良的抗旱品种能否被农户接受，取决于产量稳定性之外的多重因素：粮食品质、市场价格、加工适用性和文化偏好。参与式品种选育（Participatory Variety Selection, PVS）和参与式植物育种（Participatory Plant Breeding, PPB）将农户的选择偏好整合到育种流程中，显著提高了品种采纳率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[种质资源收集] --&gt; B[分子标记筛选]&#10;    B --&gt; C[杂交组合设计]&#10;    C --&gt; D[早代高通量表型]&#10;    D --&gt; E[基因组选择]&#10;    E --&gt; F[多环境试验]&#10;    F --&gt; G[参与式品种选育]&#10;    G --&gt; H[品种审定与推广]&#10;    H --&gt; I[种子体系建设]\">graph LR\n    A[种质资源收集] --&gt; B[分子标记筛选]\n    B --&gt; C[杂交组合设计]\n    C --&gt; D[早代高通量表型]\n    D --&gt; E[基因组选择]\n    E --&gt; F[多环境试验]\n    F --&gt; G[参与式品种选育]\n    G --&gt; H[品种审定与推广]\n    H --&gt; I[种子体系建设]</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某育种项目在三个干旱环境（早旱、花期旱、终期旱）下评估了200个小麦品系。请设计一个综合抗旱性评价指数，整合产量、产量稳定性（跨环境变异系数）和干旱敏感指数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DSI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>d</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DSI} = \\frac{1 - Y_d/Y_p}{1 - \\bar{Y}_d/\\bar{Y}_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DSI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6137em;vertical-align:-0.5814em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0323em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.6159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5814em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>），说明各组分的权重设置依据。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>对比讨论 DREB 过表达转基因方法与 CRISPR 负调控因子编辑方法在抗旱改良中的优缺点，从分子机制、田间效果、监管路径和农户接受度四个维度进行分析。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>查阅文献，找到一个利用野生近缘种基因渐渗提高栽培作物抗旱性的成功案例。分析该案例中克服了哪些遗传障碍（如连锁累赘、杂交不亲和等）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>全球气候模型预测你所关注地区2050年的降水变化趋势。基于这些预测，为该地区设计一个抗旱育种优先目标清单，包括目标性状、种质来源和技术路线。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Tardieu 等（2018）在 Annual Review of Plant Biology 发表的 &quot;Plant Phenomics, From Sensors to Knowledge&quot; 系统介绍了高通量表型技术在抗逆育种中的应用</li>\n<li>CGIAR 旱地谷物研究计划（Dryland Cereals）的技术报告记录了撒哈拉以南非洲抗旱品种选育和推广的丰富经验</li>\n<li>Tuberosa（2012）&quot;Phenotyping for drought tolerance of crops in the genomics era&quot; 提供了基因组时代抗旱表型鉴定的方法论框架</li>\n<li>中国农业科学院主导的&quot;渴基因&quot;重大科学计划产出了一批具有自主知识产权的抗旱基因和品种</li>\n<li>Varshney 等主编的《Genomics-Assisted Crop Improvement》涵盖了基因组选择和分子育种的最新进展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>抗旱作物育种是应对气候变化最直接的农业适应策略之一。从理解干旱胁迫的生理机制，到发掘抗旱遗传资源，再到利用基因组选择和基因编辑等现代工具，这一领域正在经历深刻的技术革新。然而，技术创新必须与农户需求和种子体系建设相结合，才能真正实现抗旱品种的规模化应用。自学者在此领域的学习路径应该从植物水分关系的基本生理学出发，逐步深入到分子遗传学和育种方法论，最终建立从实验室到田间的完整知识链条。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 可持续农业 — 抗旱作物育种与种质创新","id":"研究生-可持续农业-抗旱作物育种与种质创新"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"干旱胁迫的植物生理学基础","id":"干旱胁迫的植物生理学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"抗旱性的遗传基础与QTL定位","id":"抗旱性的遗传基础与qtl定位"},{"level":3,"text":"现代育种技术平台","id":"现代育种技术平台"},{"level":3,"text":"参与式品种选育与农户适应","id":"参与式品种选育与农户适应"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业碳汇与固碳","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/climate-adaptation/carbon-sequestration-farming"},"next":{"title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业政策分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/policy/agricultural-policy"}}